{
  "苔庭铠卫·雅恩": {
    "join": "把提灯拿稳，我带上值班簿。你记不清的事，我们拿原件一段段核；后面还有人，不能只顾自己走。",
    "joinEn": "Keep hold of the lantern. I will bring the duty book. Where memory fails, we will check the originals one stretch at a time. There are people behind us; we cannot think only of our own way out."
  },
  "苔庭裂角客领誓·阿珀": {
    "join": "灯别只照脚下。你带前面的人走，我在后面数人，到了路口再一起核名单。",
    "joinEn": "Do not point the lantern only at your feet. Lead the people in front; I will count those behind. At the next junction we will check the names together."
  },
  "苔庭赤角兽领誓·艾珀": {
    "join": "",
    "joinEn": ""
  },
  "苔庭裂角客领誓·欧珀": {
    "join": "",
    "joinEn": ""
  },
  "苔庭潜印客·莫恩": {
    "join": "收条交给你，这回不藏了。你提灯照路，我把每个转寄戳看清；近路是不是真的通，咱们走到头再说。",
    "joinEn": "You keep the receipt. I will not hide it this time. Hold the lantern while I check each forwarding stamp. We will call a shortcut useful after we have followed it all the way."
  },
