    "join": "把灯放稳，先照清回执上的名字。你若记不起来，我就从这一行读给你听；核完到站的人，再一起问往后那段路。",
    "joinEn": "Set the lantern down so we can read the receipt. If you cannot remember, I will start at this line and read it to you. Once we have checked the arrivals, we can ask about the onward road."
