  "炽砂修灯师·瑟罗": {
    "join": "先把汤喝了，灯芯也给我理一理。门有人接守，我陪你去核最后那批人的回执；灯照到的人，一个也别漏记。",
    "joinEn": "Finish the soup and let me trim that wick. Someone has taken over the door. I will come to check the last group’s receipt; we must account for everyone who passed through your light."
  }
